<title>RUSSIA: Yeltsin signed 1997 budget -- agencies.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin signed 1997 budget -- agencies.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Boris Yeltsin signed Russia's 1997 budget into law on Tuesday, Russian news agencies quoted Prime Minister Viktor Chernomyrdin as saying on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Chernomyrdin was speaking at a meeting of rectors of Russian universities, Itar-Tass news agency said.</p>
<p>&quot;Yesterday, as expected, Boris Nikolayevich (Yeltsin) signed the budget,&quot; Chernomyrdin was quoted as saying by his spokesman</p>
</text>
